"body": "Adds two read-only methods to the Python and JavaScript SDKs.\n\n- `rapplications()`: every installed rapplication, each with its `room` (the channel of the same slug, or none) and its `pages` (page files shared into that room).\n- `rapplication(slug)`: one rapplication with its egg attached.\n\nBuilt only from files the platform already keeps. No new state, no new action, nothing written.\n\nTests: SDK tests 26 before, 33 after (7 new). Undo: revert this merge.",
